id: partial-suppression
name: Partial Suppression
type: form
subtype: alternate
racial: Arcosian
prerequisites: Emperor Mutation Trait
line: metamorphosis
stage: 2
tier: 3+
stress: 16
aspects: Enhanced Save (Corporeal/Impulsive), Draining (LV1), Power High (LV1)
bonuses: AG +2(T), FO +2(T), TE +2(T), IN +1(T), MA +2(T)
# The Metamorphosis Forms text box: for this Stage, a Size Category, S Evolution Traits, a Tail Attack choice and a Survivor Option -
# chosen on its row, had while in it (transformations.mjs rowChoicesOf, syncWhileIn; its script below).
choice1: size | Size | small=Small; medium=Medium; large=Large
choice2: tail | Tail Attack | none=None; elongated=Elongated; multiple=Multiple; spiked=Spiked; heavy=Heavy
choice3: survivor | Survivor | dense-plating=Dense Plating; sleek-plating=Sleek Plating; power-plating=Power Plating; combat-plating=Combat Plating
choice4: evolution1 | Evolution Trait | @other:evolution
choice5: evolution2 | Evolution Trait | @other:evolution
# The Tail Attack Maneuver's choice and Survivor's Option replaced while in this Stage, put back on leaving it.
tailWhileIn: $row.tail
optionWhileIn: survivor = $row.survivor
description: >
  The overflowing power within your body is so great that- at least, at first- even you cannot control it. You must reinforce your body with layers upon layers of bio-armor, creating transformations to suppress your full power. Even with your power concealed in this way, you still remain among the strongest fighters in the universe, and when push comes to shove, you can unleash your full power, even if only for a moment.
text: >
  The overflowing power within your body is so great that- at least, at first- even you cannot control it. You must reinforce your body with layers upon layers of bio-armor, creating transformations to suppress your full power. Even with your power concealed in this way, you still remain among the strongest fighters in the universe, and when push comes to shove, you can unleash your full power, even if only for a moment.

  **Partial Suppression** — Racial Requirement: Arcosian / Form / Alternate / Prerequisite(s): Emperor Mutation Trait / Line: Metamorphosis / Stage: 2 / Stress Test Requirement: 16 / Tier of Power Requirement. 3+
  Aspects: Enhanced Save (Corporeal/Impulsive), Draining (LV1), Power High (LV1)
  AG +2(T) · FO +2(T) · TE +2(T) · SC – · IN +1(T) · MA +2(T) · PE –

  Coup de Grace: The way you overpower your prey in combat, many forget just how quickly you're capable of delivering the final blow.
  (1)-[Passive]: While you are above the Injured Health Threshold, increase your Wound Rolls and Speeds by 1(T).
  (2)-[1/Round]: As an Instant Maneuver, you may spend 2 stacks of Overwhelm to use the Basic Attack Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.
  (3)-[Triggered/Superior]: Choose a Combat Roll. Until you leave the Superior State, increase that Combat Roll by 1(T).
  (4)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If you make an Attacking Maneuver whose Damage Category would be increased beyond Lethal, that Attacking Maneuver may also ignore the Damage Reduction for all target(s) of that Attacking Maneuver.

  MASTERY TRAIT — Mutant's Resilience: Because of your overflowing power, you never seem to run out of stamina.
  (1)-[Passive]: When you regain Life Points through the 6th effect of Suppression of Power, regain Ki Points equal to 1/2 of the Life Points gained.
  (2)-[1/Round]: As an Instant Maneuver, you may spend 2 stacks of Overwhelm to gain a Counter Action.
  (3)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you trigger the 3rd effect of the Emperor Mutation Trait, enter the Superior State until the start of your next turn.
  (4)-[Triggered/Power, 1/Round]: If you haven't applied Legend Realized to a lower Stage of Metamorphosis, you may apply Legend Realized as if you were entering that Transformation.

---

# The Metamorphosis Forms text box: what was chosen for this Stage, on its row, while in it. An Evolved Stage on it uses these (it has
# none of its own; this Stage stays in use beneath it).

# "A Size Category between Small and Large. This replaces your base Size Category while you are in that Stage."
[passive]
if ($is.size.small == 1) {
    allow size.base.small;
}
if ($is.size.medium == 1) {
    allow size.base.medium;
}
if ($is.size.large == 1) {
    allow size.base.large;
}
